          `Set up tracking carefully, because without accurate attribution you will optimise blind. Tag your flows and sources so you can see which channel, creative and landing page produce depositing players rather than mere clicks. Even at the start, build the habit of looking at the whole funnel — from source to first deposit — rather than a top-line metric such as clicks or installs. Clean data from day one is what lets you later scale exactly what is profitable instead of guessing.`,
          `Discuss the minimum terms, CPA qualification thresholds and payout rules with your manager before you send meaningful volume. Understanding what counts as a qualified depositor, how any hold works, and when payments arrive protects you from surprises and helps you calculate unit economics correctly. We cover the payout mechanics in detail in our piece on <a href="/blog/sri-lanka-affiliate-payments/">how Sri Lanka affiliates get paid</a> — read it before your first significant push.`
