          `Mobile conversion ties it together. Even with the right payment methods, a heavy page or clumsy cashier on a mid-range Android handset will shed players, so favour operators whose whole deposit journey is fast and native on mobile. The best-converting brand for your traffic is usually the one that combines cricket depth, local payments and a frictionless mobile experience — and confirming that combination first-hand is worth more than any brand's reputation. We detail the payment side in <a href="/blog/sri-lanka-affiliate-payments/">how Sri Lanka affiliates get paid</a>.`
